window.MG_LAZY_DATA["data/lazy/resources/qpu-v25-016-2f85273cb469b1cd.json"]={sha256:"2f85273cb469b1cd909acfbd440167ea9a4e6906a78d77aaaad2d0da774333a2",value:{"sources":[{"id":"v25-case-2edf39976eb0ca17","url":"https://quantumai.google/cirq/tutorials/google/identifying_hardware_changes","title":"Identifying Hardware Changes","titleEn":"Identifying Hardware Changes","publisher":"Google Quantum AI","scope":"查證具名案例與原理背景。課內數值、故障資料與判準為原創教學假設；請勿當作廠商規格或操作程序。","scopeEn":"Establish named case and principle context. Numbers, fault data, and criteria are original teaching assumptions, not manufacturer specifications or operating procedures."}],"media":{"courses":[{"courseId":"qpu-v25-016","videos":[],"guides":[]}]},"related":{"courses":[{"courseId":"qpu-v25-016","related":[{"id":"qpu-v25-017","referenceUrls":["https://quantumai.google/cirq/tutorials/google/identifying_hardware_changes"],"title":"Google 讀出校正：混淆矩陣反算","titleEn":"Google readout correction: confusion-matrix inversion","why":"用兩課的可觀察驗收條件比較模型邊界：逐項標記通過、失敗或資料不足，不以熟悉品牌代替證據。最終交接必須包括：交付IQ投影、均值／方差表及保留樣本的混淆矩陣。 所有通過結論只在本課明列假設內成立。","whyEn":"Compare model boundaries using observable acceptance criteria: Mark each item pass, fail or insufficient evidence; a familiar brand is not proof. Final handover must include: Deliver IQ projections, mean/variance tables and a held-out confusion matrix. Every pass remains conditional on the stated teaching assumptions.","difference":"建立『Google 讀出校正：混淆矩陣反算』可核算的名義與變更模型，區分實際來源背景、合成輸入及驗收證據。成果：交付前向／逆向表、條件性警示與校準批次識別。","differenceEn":"Build reproducible nominal and changed models for 'Google readout correction: confusion-matrix inversion', separating sourced context, synthetic inputs and acceptance evidence. Outcome: Deliver forward/inverse tables, conditioning warnings and calibration-batch identifiers.","transfer":"保留單位與邊界條件，僅轉移可證明相容的驗證方法。","transferEn":"Retain units and boundary conditions; transfer only demonstrably compatible verification methods.","practice":["先從模型逐項推導，標記量綱與近似：等變異一維投影以d=abs(μ1−μ0)/σ量化分離度；本題不把d直接等同準確率。 使用教學μ0=−1、μ1=1、σ=0.5，單位為任意ADC單位。 以手算或試算表計算名義式(1-(-1))/0.5，另開一欄執行獨立核對：同時把兩均值加10後重算，d應不變；用獨立標註樣本量測混淆矩陣，不能由d推定非高斯尾端。","先從模型逐項推導，標記量綱與近似：設e0=P(報1給真0)、e1=P(報0給真1)，q=e0+(1−e0−e1)p；反算p=(q−e0)/(1−e0−e1)。 使用合成觀察q=0.35、e0=0.05、e1=0.10；矩陣列和須為1。 以手算或試算表計算名義式(0.35-0.05)/(1-0.05-0.10)，另開一欄執行獨立核對：將p代回前向式應還原0.35；當e0+e1趨近1時，記錄分母與噪聲放大。","比較兩個模型的輸入、誤差與驗收條件，記錄不能沿用的假設。"],"practiceEn":["Derive each term, marking dimensions and approximations: For equal-variance one-dimensional projections, d=abs(μ1−μ0)/σ measures separation; d is not itself accuracy. Use Teaching μ0=−1, μ1=1 and σ=0.5 in arbitrary ADC units. Evaluate nominal expression (1-(-1))/0.5 by hand or spreadsheet, then independently check: Add10 to both means and verify invariant d; measure a confusion matrix on independent labels instead of inferring non-Gaussian tails.","Derive each term, marking dimensions and approximations: Let e0=P(report1|true0) and e1=P(report0|true1); q=e0+(1−e0−e1)p, hence p=(q−e0)/(1−e0−e1). Use Synthetic observed q=0.35, e0=0.05 and e1=0.10; matrix columns must sum to1. Evaluate nominal expression (0.35-0.05)/(1-0.05-0.10) by hand or spreadsheet, then independently check: Forward-substitute p to recover0.35; as e0+e1 approaches1, record denominator and noise amplification.","Compare inputs, errors, and criteria; document assumptions that cannot be transferred."]},{"id":"qpu-v25-026","referenceUrls":["https://qiskit-community.github.io/qiskit-experiments/manuals/verification/randomized_benchmarking.html"],"title":"Qiskit 隨機化基準：衰減參數與 Clifford 誤差","titleEn":"Qiskit randomized benchmarking: decay parameter and Clifford error","why":"用兩課的可觀察驗收條件比較模型邊界：逐項標記通過、失敗或資料不足，不以熟悉品牌代替證據。最終交接必須包括：交付IQ投影、均值／方差表及保留樣本的混淆矩陣。 所有通過結論只在本課明列假設內成立。","whyEn":"Compare model boundaries using observable acceptance criteria: Mark each item pass, fail or insufficient evidence; a familiar brand is not proof. Final handover must include: Deliver IQ projections, mean/variance tables and a held-out confusion matrix. Every pass remains conditional on the stated teaching assumptions.","difference":"建立『Qiskit 隨機化基準：衰減參數與 Clifford 誤差』可核算的名義與變更模型，區分實際來源背景、合成輸入及驗收證據。成果：交付衰減曲線、SPAM／EPC區分及批次穩定性報告。","differenceEn":"Build reproducible nominal and changed models for 'Qiskit randomized benchmarking: decay parameter and Clifford error', separating sourced context, synthetic inputs and acceptance evidence. Outcome: Deliver decay curves, SPAM/EPC distinctions and a batch-stability report.","transfer":"保留單位與邊界條件，僅轉移可證明相容的驗證方法。","transferEn":"Retain units and boundary conditions; transfer only demonstrably compatible verification methods.","practice":["先從模型逐項推導，標記量綱與近似：等變異一維投影以d=abs(μ1−μ0)/σ量化分離度；本題不把d直接等同準確率。 使用教學μ0=−1、μ1=1、σ=0.5，單位為任意ADC單位。 以手算或試算表計算名義式(1-(-1))/0.5，另開一欄執行獨立核對：同時把兩均值加10後重算，d應不變；用獨立標註樣本量測混淆矩陣，不能由d推定非高斯尾端。","先從模型逐項推導，標記量綱與近似：擬合P(m)=Aα^m+B後，單量子位元EPC=(1−α)/2；依賴RB模型，不是每個原生門的錯誤。 使用教學α=0.998，A=0.48，B=0.5；Clifford長度m無單位。 以手算或試算表計算名義式(1-0.998)/2，另開一欄執行獨立核對：生成m=0、100、200的P值再反推α；P(0)=0.98而非1是SPAM參數造成，不應強制改寫。","比較兩個模型的輸入、誤差與驗收條件，記錄不能沿用的假設。"],"practiceEn":["Derive each term, marking dimensions and approximations: For equal-variance one-dimensional projections, d=abs(μ1−μ0)/σ measures separation; d is not itself accuracy. Use Teaching μ0=−1, μ1=1 and σ=0.5 in arbitrary ADC units. Evaluate nominal expression (1-(-1))/0.5 by hand or spreadsheet, then independently check: Add10 to both means and verify invariant d; measure a confusion matrix on independent labels instead of inferring non-Gaussian tails.","Derive each term, marking dimensions and approximations: After fitting P(m)=Aα^m+B, single-qubit EPC=(1−α)/2; this RB-model quantity is not every native gate error. Use Teaching α=0.998, A=0.48 and B=0.5; Clifford length m is dimensionless. Evaluate nominal expression (1-0.998)/2 by hand or spreadsheet, then independently check: Generate P at m=0,100,200 and recover α; P(0)=0.98 reflects SPAM parameters and should not be forced to1.","Compare inputs, errors, and criteria; document assumptions that cannot be transferred."]}],"references":[{"id":"v25-case-2edf39976eb0ca17","url":"https://quantumai.google/cirq/tutorials/google/identifying_hardware_changes","title":"Identifying Hardware Changes","titleEn":"Identifying Hardware Changes","publisher":"Google Quantum AI","scope":"查證具名案例與原理背景。課內數值、故障資料與判準為原創教學假設；請勿當作廠商規格或操作程序。","scopeEn":"Establish named case and principle context. Numbers, fault data, and criteria are original teaching assumptions, not manufacturer specifications or operating procedures."},{"id":"v25-case-9dad25457bdb4a58","url":"https://qiskit-community.github.io/qiskit-experiments/manuals/verification/randomized_benchmarking.html","title":"Randomized Benchmarking","titleEn":"Randomized Benchmarking","publisher":"Qiskit Experiments","scope":"查證具名案例與原理背景。課內數值、故障資料與判準為原創教學假設；請勿當作廠商規格或操作程序。","scopeEn":"Establish named case and principle context. Numbers, fault data, and criteria are original teaching assumptions, not manufacturer specifications or operating procedures."}],"overview":"比較相鄰案例與另一組案例的模型、可量測結果及可轉移的驗證方法。","overviewEn":"Compare neighboring and cross-group cases by model, measurable outcome, and transferable verification method."}]},"places":{"courses":[]},"vendors":{"courses":[],"vendors":[]}}};
